  "title": "Mongolian Chicken",
  "description": "If Mongolian beef is your go-to when it comes to Chinese take-out, try this version made with chicken - the chicken comes out incredibly tender and requires no marinating time.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
